Article 7 (Duties of the Secretary, etc.)
(1) The Committee shall have one Secretary and one Deputy Secretary. The Director-General of the Planning and Coordination Office shall serve as Secretary, and the officer in charge of audit strategy shall serve as Deputy Secretary. <Amended on Jun. 30, 2016; Aug. 29, 2022>
(2) The Secretary shall perform the following duties: <Amended on Jun. 30, 2016; Aug. 29, 2022>
1. Assisting the Chairperson in the operation of the Committee;
2. Handling administrative affairs relating to the work of the Committee;
3. Cooperating in the provision of materials to Committee members;
4. Preparing and preserving the minutes of Committee meetings, etc.;
5. Reporting the results of Committee meetings to the Chairperson of the Board of Audit and Inspection.
